["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Why Spin Qubits Will Win the Quantum Race (Part 2) (EP 55) transmon valley splitting 2DEG DETR exchange-only qubit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-fromfirstprinc-硅自旋将赢-百万比特只需一块硅晶圆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">3:46:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>量子终局不是比比特干净，是比谁能用手机芯片产线量产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子计算的终局不是比谁的比特更干净，而是比谁能用现有半导体产线量产；硅自旋比特复用 TSMC 光刻机，而离子阱卡在十万束激光、超导卡在仓库级制冷机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span><span class=\"tag\">硅自旋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Future GPUs Will Look Like This back-end design services HBM CoWoS scaleup fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-techtechpotato-未来-ai-定制芯片的形态-一只带-16-个-hbm-的巨兽/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f1cfd222dffd8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">11:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 芯片出货量将跳一个量级：从百万颗到 1500 万颗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Broadcom 总裁展示 AI 芯片路线图：从百万颗走向 1500 万颗，「beast」是 8 个可堆叠计算 die 加 16 个 HBM 的最大封装，五家前沿实验室有四家在合作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定制芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">ASIC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Percy Fawcett, Manuscript 512, and a Lost City in the Amazon, Pt. 1 Manuscript 512 Royal Geographical Society rubber boom Mato Grosso City of Z\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-stuffmissed-福西特不是去冒险-是去给橡胶资本画地图/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>探险家为一座虚构古城丧命，源头是一份政治伪造文件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Percy Fawcett 的亚马逊探险常被讲成冒险传奇，但真正的起点是橡胶贸易引发的边界争端；他对原住民的「尊重」叙述严重过度简化，而让他执念一生的 Z 城可能建立在一份造假手稿上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">探险史</span><span class=\"tag\">亚马逊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"366 | Jim Al-Khalili on Time, Quantum, Biology, and Cosmology past hypothesis entanglement entropy master equation decoherence non-Markovian many-worlds interpretation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mindscape-时间的方向性比时间对称方程更根本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>时间不是幻觉：不可逆性比对称方程更根本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jim Al-Khalili 主张时间是真实的、有方向的，不可逆性比时间对称方程更根本；他还提出用量子纠缠熵代替热力学熵作为过去假设的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">时间箭头</span><span class=\"tag\">量子力学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Hamas and the Future of Gaza (with Ahmed Fouad Alkhatib) Shikaki polls NCAG Great Reset UNRWA DSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-econtalk-加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯-缴械窗口正在打开/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>加沙多数人已抛弃哈马斯，缴械窗口正在打开</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加沙出生的政策学者 Alkhatib 用四层反对、两份民调和人口数据论证：多数加沙人早已反哈马斯，哈马斯可能被迫阶段性缴械；但主持人 Russ 的悲观提醒，缴械对哈马斯等于政治自杀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加沙</span><span class=\"tag\">哈马斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Gavin Baker: Why AI Demand Is Outrunning Compute Supply Neocloud RVG ZDR EV to net PP&amp;E Jalapeno\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-a16z-ai-不是供给过剩-是严重供给不足/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是供给过剩，是严重供给不足</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有人都在担心 AI 数据中心建太多，Gavin Baker 的结论相反：到 2028 年真正的问题是严重供给不足，算力价格可能不降反升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E173.财报的根 + 估值的茎 = 叙事的果实 DCF CAPM 解析解 内生性 景气度陷阱\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-mianji-决定股价的不是增速-是叙事变化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0757a046b9ac401-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>决定股价的不是增速，是叙事变化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">增速本身不产生超额收益，兑现叙事只赚折现率；决定股价高度的是叙事，决定股价涨跌的是叙事的变化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">A股</span><span class=\"tag\">估值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Donald Kohn on the Fed&#x27;s Past, Present, and Future interest on reserves asymmetric corridor system ample reserves discount window five by five market-based core\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-macromusings-美联储前副主席-缩表最大的障碍不是经济-是政治/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dd40cbb3f2bb1505-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美联储前副主席：缩表最大的障碍不是经济，是政治</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">银行家不愿用贴现窗口，不是怕罚息，是怕两年后国会公布借款记录、老板被叫去作证。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">货币政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Richmond Fed’s Tom Barkin on the Surprisingly Resilient Real Economy SEP dot plot R-star forward guidance private label\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-oddlots-美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美国经济韧性来自消费者向未来借钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkin拆解了消费为何在高物价下依然强劲：消费者降低储蓄、拖欠账单、延期还贷来维持支出；AI投资目前更多是涨价和挤出，而非生产率红利；美联储或需长期逆风。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费韧性</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bessent&#x27;s Wager and Why the World is Calling America&#x27;s Bluff | Henry Farrell Pascal&#x27;s wager weaponized interdependence flexible realism unitary executive neo-royalism busted flush\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-hiddenforces-美国财长用神罚威胁盟国-反而证明手里没牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">51:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>美国财长用神罚威胁盟国，反而证明手里没牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美财长 Bessent 把美国描写成易怒的神，要盟国像信帕斯卡赌局一样臣服。Farrell 看穿这篇社论：威胁越响亮，越证明美国没有兑现手段，盟国已经开始自保。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">贸易战</span><span class=\"tag\">美元体系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"#431 How Henry Singleton Worked capital allocation tender offer float PE ratio\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-founders-他把90-的股票买回来-年化回报20-4/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/87659403ab58b42d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">49:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Founders</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>他把90%的股票买回来，年化回报20.4%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大多数CEO只会经营，不会配置资本。Singleton把资本配置当主业：股票太便宜就买自己的股票，买不到好公司就一股不再发。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资本配置</span><span class=\"tag\">股票回购</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part One) Cartesian Theater Multiple Drafts Model Phi phenomenon Qualia Homunculus Stalinesque vs. Orwellian\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-pel-笛卡尔剧场不存在-意识不是放映-而是多重草稿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a66360fe1170966-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>意识没有终点线：大脑是多重草稿，不是放映厅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 反对「笛卡尔剧场」：没有单一终点线让所有感觉汇入意识；大脑是并行判别、互不汇总的多重草稿，连「你什么时候意识到」都常常没有事实答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识</span><span class=\"tag\">哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"漫长的告别：失智症、照护者与终将老去的我们 Hogeweyk The Soul of Care informal care long-term care insurance wet-on-wet watercolor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-31-cn300980-失智照护的难不在失智老人-而在会被拖垮的照护者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合时宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0831</span></div>\n<h2>失智照护的难不在失智老人，而在会被拖垮的照护者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">失智照护的难不在老人病情本身，而在被日复一日拖垮的照护者——照护把妻子变成护士、让90后辞职，爱是起点却不是支撑，制度还没接住这些家庭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">失智症</span><span class=\"tag\">老年照护</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"701. Roman Civil War: Rise of the General (Part 1) novus homo cursus honorum popularis tribune of the plebs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-restishistory-罗马共和国不是被外敌打垮-是被自己人第一次带兵进城/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>罗马共和国不是被外敌打垮，是被自己人第一次带兵进城</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马略与苏拉这对自造者与贵族的对决，第一次让罗马军队开进罗马城，也第一次把公敌名单钉在城中心——共和国从此走上不归路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马共和国</span><span class=\"tag\">马略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Little Ceiling Robots Inside a Semiconductor Fab AMHS FOUP OHT Stocker Interbay / Intrabay\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-asianometry-别只盯着光刻机-天花板上的-oht-小车也在卡产能/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c6301489e9b3f727-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">20:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>晶圆厂瓶颈不在光刻机，在天花板上的 OHT 小车</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">晶圆厂里真正卡产能的不只光刻机，还有天花板上来回跑的 OHT 小车。300mm 转型让它们成为必需品，如今这个市场被 Daifuku 和 Muratec 双头垄断。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AMHS</span><span class=\"tag\">OHT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"391. Road To 9/11: The Rise of Osama Bin Laden (Part 3) Hadramat Wahhabi Muslim Brotherhood globalists\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-empirehist-本-拉登不是穷小子逆袭-是沙特王室建筑商的富家子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登不是穷小子逆袭，是沙特王室建筑商的富家子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">奥萨马·本·拉登是穆罕默德·本·拉登第17个儿子，童年拿的是几十万美元级别的分红，读的是吉达唯一的精英走读学校——他的激进不是贫困的产物，是特权与 Brotherhood 招募的产物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">本·拉登</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Scott Bessent Is at War With Prices — and Prices Are Winning! TGA (Treasury General Account) On-the-run vs off-the-run bonds Duration neutral Term premium Stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-patrickboyle-贝森特与价格的战争-财政部长的宏观赌局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>财长压债市如交易头寸，价格终将获胜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国财长贝森特正以交易员思维干预债市、贸易与制裁，但通胀与赤字使价格持续上涨，其策略或成空谈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国债</span><span class=\"tag\">财政政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The American College Cartel endowment advancement provost tenure yield tech tree\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-modernmba-精英大学是制造稀缺的卡特尔-而非教育机构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3676f3a101faa05c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">45:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>精英大学是卡特尔：卖的是身份，不是教育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国精英大学不是慈善教育机构，而是靠冻结招生规模、运营校友捐赠和承接联邦研究拨款来维持品牌的卡特尔；它们卖的是身份，不是教育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大学财政</span><span class=\"tag\">捐赠基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies SSR bet-hedging contingency locus hybridoma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体用随机突变下注-ebv人类抗体首次成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:52:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌体靠10,000倍回复突变下注，EBV人源化抗体首现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">噬菌体通过 SSR 的 10,000 倍回复突变实现赌注对冲，EBV 人源化抗体在体内阻止肿瘤，疫苗多路线推进。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span><span class=\"tag\">赌注 hedging</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1353: Phage bet-hedging and EBV antibodies simple sequence repeats (SSR) bet-hedging hybridoma HAT medium humanized mice\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-twiv-噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异-赌细菌防御会升级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>噬菌体靠复制打滑预留变异，赌细菌防御会升级</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">打滑不是复制故障，而是噬菌体的一种对冲：群体里常有少数个体因重复序列改变读码框，生成还没被选中的变异。平时多数适应当下环境，细菌防御一升级，低频备选立刻接管。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">噬菌体</span><span class=\"tag\">赌注对冲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Non-Coders Are Vibe Coding $100K+ Businesses with AI | Amol Jain Vibe coding TAM System of record MCP Token maxing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-peteryang-代码成本归零后-用户为判断力与分发付费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9c1f372be129004-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">36:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Peter Yang</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>代码免费后，用户为判断力与分发付费</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Replit 工程负责人给出检验标准：代码免费化后，只有信任、数据、基础设施、实物与网络能留存；非程序员靠领域知识三天做出月入 18 万美元的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">vibe coding</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI’s third era: the rise of persistent AI coworkers | Tara Seshan (OpenAI’s product lead) persistent co-worker product marketing fit\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-lennys-ai-第三纪元是持久协作者-产品周期只有三个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67bb7dafb90c60da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>AI 第三纪元是持久协作者，产品周期只有三个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 产品负责人 Tara Seshan 断言，AI 产品正从聊天、代理走向持久协作者，构建必须按两到三个月的模型能力设计；未来工作是掌舵而非划桨，写作即思考永不上自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品周期</span><span class=\"tag\">持久协作者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a16z Launched the Machine Age Fund | Jen Kha Machine Age Fund custom silicon liquid cooling DC powered hyperscaler American Dynamism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-30-a16z-风投正在回到硬件-ai-把资本重新拉回物理世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0830</span></div>\n<h2>风投正在回到硬件：AI 把资本重新拉回物理世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去三十年风投一路远离硬件，AI 把它拉了回来。a16z 新设 11 亿美元机器时代基金，赌的是软件栈之下那层被荒废了三十年的物理基础设施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">风投</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: USN Readiness Reckoning, Steampunk Navy, and AI Cyberwar with Shashank of the Economist MRO CCA agentic AI offense-defense balance air gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-29-chinatalk-美国海军被自己跑废了-下一场危机没有航母可用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1715b2e29491685-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>美国海军被自己跑废了，下一场危机没有航母可用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三年中东高强度部署把舰队和人都烧穿了：接下来几年可能同时只有一艘航母在海上，而对手正看着这个空档。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美军战备</span><span class=\"tag\">航母</span>\n</div></div></a>"]